model own01
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-12-31
  note "OWN-01: a savings account opened on 1 March with a month-end fee; the fees of the first quarter and net worth on 15 February."
  note "Each account is a thing with a lifespan (LANGUAGE 5.7, 5.10): before it opens it is in no binding, so it has no line. The fee applies by kind, to every savings account alive at a month's end (a move keyed by a kind, 5.14)."

source card "Probe card OWN-01 (made up): story and rules"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

kind savings_accounts: place DUK signed

place bank_fees: outside lives 2025-01-01..

input fee_amount: money DUK

move fee[m in months, x in savings_accounts on add_days(end_of(m), -1)]: transfers
  on add_days(end_of(m), -1)
  leg cash from x to bank_fees amount fee_amount
  note "rule 2: the fee at the end of each month the account is open"

ask q_a_fees: flows(fee, 2025-01..2025-03)

ask q_b_lines: bal(x, 2025-02-15) for x in places on 2025-02-15 where not (x in outside)

ask q_b_net_worth: sum(bal(x, 2025-02-15) for x in places on 2025-02-15 where not x in outside)

version card_facts
  cite card
  known 2025-01-01
  anchor current
  note "current: held for years, opened 2015-01-01 (the card's inputs); savings: opened on 1 March 2025"
  accounts + [current] DUK lives 2015-01-01..
  savings_accounts + [savings] lives 2025-03-01..
  stated[current] = 1000.00 at 2025-02-15 end "story: holds 1 000.00 on 15 February 2025"

version card_rules
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  fee_amount = 5.00 "rule 2: a fee of 5.00 at each month's end while open"
